<title>USA: Seabrook Island, S.C., yields 5.65 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Seabrook Island, S.C., yields 5.65 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>JC Bradford &amp; Co said it tentatively priced $6.95 0 million of Seabrook Island, S.C., water and sewer system revenue bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.65 percent in 2027.</p>
